    "detailed_description": "A killer clown is after you!<br>There are 8 cards scattered throughout each level.<br>Rumor has it, the cards emit a strange sound. So listen carefully!<br>You must find all 8 cards and banish the clown for good.<br><br>Run, hide &amp; survive in this terrifying first person horror title.<br>And remember, the CLOWN can hear you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Survive</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Be quiet! The CLOWN can hear you and running will only make it easier for him to find you.<br></li><li> Explore the levels and listen out for the &quot;humming&quot; sound emitted from the playing cards.<br></li><li> Jump, climb and make your way through a series of mazes and puzzles.<br></li><li> Be careful though! Jumping makes a noise and will only let the CLOWN know where you are.<br></li><li> Rumor has it, the CLOWN can duplicate himself to make searching for you that much easier.<br></li><li> Remember where you've been so you don't end up getting lost!<br></li><li> The CLOWN is fast, but you are faster. Sprint to get ahead and out of reach until he decides to stop chasing you.<br></li><li> Use your flashlight to illuminate dark areas, be careful though, the CLOWN can hear the &quot;click&quot; of your flashlight.<br></li><li> Find all 8 playing cards in each level to win the level and banish the CLOWN.</li></ul><br>What are you waiting for? Go and find the cards before he finds you!",
